                                "sense_id": "c938f4e9-6778-372c-8556-862ea04c6737",
                                "text": "Owing to soil erosion, some farmland has become totally barren. In Chenjiagedu Village, Fugu county, Shanxi^([sic – meaning Shaanxi]) Province, since all farmland was lost, the local people were obliged to travel several kilometers for fertile soil.",
                                "translation": "Lü you ying yu jiao cheng",
                                "english": "Lü you ying yu jiao cheng"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "495af72b-d2f8-43e5-bb83-8168b98a4050",
                                "sense_id": "c938f4e9-6778-372c-8556-862ea04c6737",
                                "text": "The explosion occurred in the afternoon in Xinmin, a town in Fugu County, Shaanxi Province, and by early Tuesday rescuers had counted 147 wounded, 113 of whom had been hospitalized, according to Xinhua, the main state news agency."
                            }
